{
  "comment": [
    "Particle recipes (Phase B, B0.7): presentation data, not game content. Each is one GPUParticles3D built by ParticleRecipes.cs -",
    "a burst (all at once, once) or a stream - of camera-facing quads showing a texture (a flipbook when grid is given, played at fps),",
    "coloured along a ramp over each particle's life and scaled along size_curve. Distances in metres, speeds in metres a second.",
    "Textures are asset-workspace paths; every one carries its provenance record beside it (vfx/<id>.json).",
    "An effect may also name a formula form, form:<name> (Art/FormulaForms.cs): geometry drawn by its own shader - the ward's lattice, the",
    "mending's threads, the cast glyph, the bolt's core and its pressure front. formulas: each formula's ink and its glyph's polygon.",
    "Asset overhaul 2026-10-14 (asset_work/vfx): pivot base (a flame stands on its wick), soft (proximity fade), spin (deg/s) and",
    "billboard velocity (a streak along the flight) need the ParticleRecipes.cs patch beside this file; fps 0 on a grid = one random frame."
  ],
  "effects": {
    "comment": "What the game draws with recipes (--visual vfx=recipes): a flipbook effect's ID, or a greybox moment's key, to the recipes that stand in for it. hit.<material>: HitImpacts (authoritative HitResolved only).",
    "vfx.force.impulse_bolt_travel": ["form:bolt_core", "force_bolt_wake"],
    "vfx.force.impulse_bolt_impact": ["form:bolt_shock", "force_bolt_shards", "force_bolt_dust"],
    "arrow_strike": ["impact_sparks"],
    "vfx.vital.mending_thread_restore": ["form:mending_weave", "mending_motes"],
    "vfx.warding.brace_ward_shell": ["form:ward_lattice"],
    "vfx.magic.cast_charge": ["form:cast_glyph"],
    "hit.flesh": ["hit_blood_splash", "hit_blood_drops", "hit_blood_mist"],
    "hit.metal": ["hit_metal_sparks", "hit_metal_flash"],
    "hit.bone": ["hit_bone_dust", "hit_bone_chips"],
    "hit.ember": ["hit_blood_splash", "hit_ember_burst"],
    "hit.blocked": ["hit_metal_sparks"],
    "dust.kick": ["dust_kick"]
  },
  "hit_materials": {
    "comment": "What a struck body is made of, by creature definition (HitImpacts.cs); anything not listed, and the player, bleeds.",
    "creature.construct.animated_armour": "metal",
    "creature.undead.bone_walker_husk": "bone",
    "creature.beast.ash_ember_hound": "ember"
  },
  "formulas": {
    "comment": "The cast glyph per formula (Phase B VFX lane): its ink, and the polygon turning inside it - Force three sides, Warding four, Vital six.",
    "spell.force.impulse_bolt": { "ink": "#d6e6ff", "sides": 3 },
    "spell.warding.brace_ward": { "ink": "#a4c8ff", "sides": 4 },
    "spell.vital.mending_thread": { "ink": "#ffe4ae", "sides": 6 }
  },
